C1   renormalisation: HT + vacuum is invariant under Lambda -> Lambda + delta, Lambda_v -> Lambda_v - delta (up to a total derivative)
  [OK ] C1a  without the tie: Delta L = 2 delta d_mu B^mu (a total derivative), metric equations unchanged
