H    health of the (Lambda, B) sector
  [OK ] H1a  velocity Hessian of (Lambda, B^mu) is zero: no kinetic term, so no sign to get wrong
  [OK ] H1b  momentum conjugate to B^0 is 2 Lambda (a first-order pair; one global mode)
  [OK ] H1c  gauge symmetry B^mu -> B^mu + d_nu omega^[mu nu]: d_mu B^mu unchanged (3 of 4 components are gauge)
