  [PASS] H3   c_T = c: the added terms carry no metric derivative; tensor sector = the parent's (v3s, beta = 0: c_T = c)

C2   time dependence (reported, not graded): d_mu Lambda = 0, so the tied vacuum has w = -1 exactly and
